{"translation-revision-date":"2026-08-10 09:58:42+0000","generator":"GlotPress\/4.0.3","domain":"messages","locale_data":{"messages":{"":{"domain":"messages","plural-forms":"nplurals=2; plural=n > 1;","lang":"tr"},"Run your store from anywhere with the Woo mobile app.":["Woo mobil uygulamas\u0131yla ma\u011fazan\u0131z\u0131 her yerden y\u00f6netin."],"Sign-in complete":["Giri\u015f tamamland\u0131"],"Or get a WordPress.com sign-in link by email:":["Veya e-posta ile WordPress.com giri\u015f ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 al\u0131n:"],"Scan the QR code below with your phone to sign in instantly \u2014 no password needed.":["An\u0131nda giri\u015f yapmak i\u00e7in a\u015fa\u011f\u0131daki QR kodu telefonunuzla taray\u0131n \u2014 \u015fifre gerekmez."],"Signed in":["Giri\u015f yap\u0131ld\u0131"],"The mobile app will be signed out the next time it tries to reach your store. You can sign in again any time by scanning a new QR code.":["Mobil uygulama, ma\u011fazan\u0131za ula\u015fmaya \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131\u011f\u0131 bir sonraki seferde oturumu kapatacakt\u0131r. \u0130stedi\u011finiz zaman yeni bir QR kod tarayarak tekrar giri\u015f yapabilirsiniz."],"Revoke access?":["Eri\u015fim iptal edilsin mi?"],"It wasn't you?":["Siz de\u011fil miydiniz?"],"You're sending requests too quickly. Please wait a moment and try again.":["\u0130stekler \u00e7ok h\u0131zl\u0131 g\u00f6nderiliyor. L\u00fctfen bir an bekleyin ve tekrar deneyin."],"Failed to revoke access. Please try again or remove the application password manually under Users \u2192 Profile.":["Eri\u015fim iptal edilemedi. L\u00fctfen tekrar deneyin veya uygulama parolas\u0131n\u0131 Kullan\u0131c\u0131lar \u2192 Profil alt\u0131ndan manuel olarak kald\u0131r\u0131n."],"Signed in successfully":["Ba\u015far\u0131yla giri\u015f yap\u0131ld\u0131"],"The mobile app will be signed out the next time it makes a request.":["Mobil uygulama bir sonraki istekte oturumu kapatacakt\u0131r."],"Access revoked":["Eri\u015fim iptal edi